<title>SYRIA: Syria buys 12,000 tonnes of rice at $345.</title>
<headline>Syria buys 12,000 tonnes of rice at $345.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foostuffs (GEZA) has bought12,000 tonnes of white rice at $345 per tonne, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters the rice would be delivered in May.</p>
</text>
